        "original_id": "4a7ef198-0a18-5a15-8643-7865cae175f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Myles Kennedy, Mark Tremonti, Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette\n- Bands: Alter Bridge, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators, SafetySuit\n- Places: Tulsa, Oklahoma, Nashville, Tennessee\n- Songs and Albums: \"Rise Today\", Blackbird, Life Left to Go\n- Record Labels: Universal Motown Records\n\nFacts:\n- Myles Kennedy, born Myles Richard Bass on November 27, 1969, is an American musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Myles Kennedy is best known as the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Alter Bridge.\n- Myles Kennedy is also the lead vocalist in Slash's backing band, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\n- \"Rise Today\" was written by Alter Bridge lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy.\n- \"Rise Today\" was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette and featured on Alter Bridge's 2007 second studio album Blackbird.\n- SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma, that is currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\n- Life Left to Go is the debut studio album by SafetySuit.\n- Life Left to Go was released on May 13, 2008, through Universal Motown Records.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "491e4ee7-5898-59bd-a793-11ecccae6eaa",
        "text": "Page: Myles Kennedy. Sentence: Myles Richard Kennedy (born Myles Richard Bass; November 27, 1969) is an American musician, singer, and songwriter, best known as the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of the rock band Alter Bridge, and as the lead vocalist in guitarist Slash's backing band, known as Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\nPage: SafetySuit. Sentence: SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma, currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\nPage: Rise Today. Sentence: Written by lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy, it was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette and featured on the band's 2007 second studio album \"Blackbird\".\nPage: Life Left to Go. Sentence: Life Left to Go is the debut studio album by American rock band SafetySuit, released on May 13, 2008, through Universal Motown Records.",
